WEBVTT

00:23:55.180 --> 00:23:59.020
You must keep the important things in your stomach.

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:01.160
I'll lose it.

00:24:43.340 --> 00:24:46.690
I wonder what's inside that egg.

00:24:50.850 --> 00:24:52.900
I can't tell you that.

00:24:54.330 --> 00:24:56.680
I don't know you.

00:24:58.250 --> 00:25:00.000
You have to break the egg.

00:25:00.700 --> 00:25:04.100
I don't know what's in it.

00:25:47.050 --> 00:25:48.660
Who are you?

00:29:35.470 --> 00:29:36.530
The baby's out.

00:36:46.800 --> 00:36:53.840
Please, promise me that you won't do anything to my egg.

00:38:04.160 --> 00:38:10.450
I've seen the same tree as you.

00:38:10.450 --> 00:38:12.420
When was it?

00:38:12.420 --> 00:38:18.650
It's so far away that I forget.

00:38:18.650 --> 00:38:21.650
Under the sky where the sound of the clouds is flowing.

00:38:21.650 --> 00:38:30.000
A black horizon was born with excitement as it is.

00:38:31.400 --> 00:38:34.050
Sucking out the steam from the ground.

00:38:34.050 --> 00:38:36.670
Stretching the honeycomb branch.

00:38:36.670 --> 00:38:39.180
Grabbing something.

00:38:39.180 --> 00:38:46.450
A big bird that keeps sleeping in the egg.

00:38:46.450 --> 00:38:48.990
What happened to that bird?

00:38:48.990 --> 00:38:58.030
Where is it?

00:38:58.030 --> 00:39:00.000
It's still there.

00:39:01.150 --> 00:39:03.340
I'm still dreaming.

00:39:03.340 --> 00:39:08.150
Dreaming? What kind of dreams do birds have?

00:39:08.150 --> 00:39:13.670
Can you tell me what's inside that egg?

00:40:50.250 --> 00:40:58.050
Since when have you been here?

00:40:58.050 --> 00:41:00.000
I only saw the number of bottles you collected.

00:41:06.360 --> 00:41:10.110
I forgot where I came from.

00:41:10.110 --> 00:41:17.060
I don't know where I'm going from now on.

00:41:17.060 --> 00:41:18.790
Are you going somewhere?

00:41:39.400 --> 00:41:44.680
I shall remove the man I have created from the surface of my land.

00:41:44.680 --> 00:41:50.950
I shall not destroy any animal or bird from my land until it reaches the sky.

00:41:50.950 --> 00:41:54.930
I shall be the one who creates it.

00:41:54.930 --> 00:41:56.230
Now, seven days have passed.

00:41:56.230 --> 00:42:00.000
I, Shiju-Nichi Shiju-Ya, shall rain on the land.

00:42:00.220 --> 00:42:10.010
All the things I have made, I will remove them from the surface of the earth.

00:42:10.010 --> 00:42:16.220
Seven days later, the flood came to the earth.

00:42:16.220 --> 00:42:22.410
On that day, the source of the great flood, Minayabure, was opened by Amano.

00:42:22.410 --> 00:42:26.110
It rained 40 days and 40 nights and poured into the earth.

00:42:26.110 --> 00:42:30.000
The ark floated on the surface of the water.

00:42:30.220 --> 00:42:34.320
and those who hate them, birds, livestock, animals,

00:42:34.320 --> 00:42:38.510
and all that dwell in the earth, as well as human beings, will all die.

00:42:38.510 --> 00:42:42.650
Those who have the breath of life in their nose,

00:42:42.650 --> 00:42:45.760
and those who are in all their bodies, will all die.

00:42:45.760 --> 00:42:51.920
But with him, only those who are in the ark remain.

00:43:01.600 --> 00:43:06.170
From the surface of the ground, he saw a pond full of water.

00:43:06.170 --> 00:43:14.350
"Don't let go of the bird. Go back to him again."

00:43:14.350 --> 00:43:16.640
Where did the bird reach?

00:43:16.640 --> 00:43:19.580
Or was it drunk by the water?

00:43:19.580 --> 00:43:22.060
No one knew.

00:43:22.060 --> 00:43:25.300
So people kept waiting for him to return.

00:43:25.300 --> 00:43:27.680
They waited and waited.

00:43:27.680 --> 00:43:29.830
One day, he forgot that he had let go of the bird.

00:43:30.030 --> 00:43:48.050
I forgot about the bird, the world that sank under the water, where did we come from, how long have we been here, where are we going, it's a story so long ago that the beasts become stones.

00:43:48.050 --> 00:44:00.000
The bird I saw was also a distant memory that I can't remember when and where it was, maybe it was a dream.

00:44:03.260 --> 00:44:09.070
You and I are only memories of those who have long gone away, like those fish.

00:44:09.910 --> 00:44:13.590
Maybe it's just that it's raining in a world where there's no one.

00:44:15.150 --> 00:44:18.120
Maybe birds have never been around since the beginning.

00:45:06.680 --> 00:45:18.150
I'm right here, right here, right here

00:46:13.500 --> 00:46:14.770
I found it.

00:46:14.770 --> 00:46:17.950
It's already a stone, but it's in here.

00:46:17.950 --> 00:46:19.930
I'll warm it up and give it back.

00:46:19.930 --> 00:46:22.280
It's the bird I found.

00:46:31.720 --> 00:46:33.750
I knew it.

00:47:25.050 --> 00:47:26.400
Can you hear me?

00:47:44.240 --> 00:47:46.960
The sound of small breath.

00:47:46.960 --> 00:47:49.800
That's the sound of your chest.

00:47:49.800 --> 00:47:53.910
The sound of your wings.

00:47:53.910 --> 00:47:56.360
I'm dreaming of flying in the sky.

00:47:56.360 --> 00:47:58.770
That's the sound of the wind outside.

00:48:02.560 --> 00:48:09.350
Right now I'm dreaming in here, but I'll show it to you too, Chiki.

00:48:09.350 --> 00:48:17.960
Until then, it won't rain here.

00:49:44.080 --> 00:49:44.560
Kimi...
